WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,050
Back to the old lady, the maids are being recruited from the camp.

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:05,850
The afternoon before yesterday, Miss He came back from Six Girls' Courtyard

3
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,850
Give her a small magnetic bottle and tell her to put it away

4
00:00:07,850 --> 00:00:09,850
Official peach juice inside

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:13,050
That magnetic bottle was not meant to frame me at all.

6
00:00:13,050 --> 00:00:15,050
I brought it to Cai Qing to see.

7
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,270
It's to make her open her mouth

8
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:19,620
It's over. It's over.

9
00:00:19,620 --> 00:00:22,620
You are a girl from the He family. I can’t punish you.

10
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,620
I'll have someone take you back to He's home early tomorrow morning

11
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,220
Tell your parents exactly what happened

12
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:33,810
Let them figure it out

13
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,810
Pingninghou Mansion cannot tolerate people with despicable conduct.

14
00:00:37,810 --> 00:00:50,150
Mother, it couldn’t be Lou Yiniang who framed Qingying

15
00:00:50,150 --> 00:00:53,150
That Hu girl is used to these dirty tricks.

16
00:00:53,150 --> 00:00:55,150
Maybe she bribed Qingying's maid
